---
// Closing punchline + signed letter + minimal links. The "0"
// counter is the screenshot-bait moment.
---

<footer class="px-6 pt-32 pb-16 border-t border-[var(--color-border-subtle)] mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <!-- The closing punchline. Editorial, big, simple. -->
    <div class="mb-24 md:mb-32 text-center">
      <p class="text-sm font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mb-8">
        Bytes Pace sent off your Mac today
      </p>
      <div
        class="pace-display text-[var(--color-positive)] tracking-tighter"
        style="font-size: clamp(7rem, 22vw, 18rem); line-height: 0.85;"
        aria-label="Zero"
      >
        0
      </div>
      <p class="mt-8 pace-margin-note text-base md:text-lg">
        Same number tomorrow.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Signed letter, full-width, with hanging indent like a real
         letter would have. -->
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto pace-prose mb-20">
      <p class="pace-margin-note text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mb-6 not-italic font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">
        A note from me
      </p>
      <p>
        I built Pace because every assistant I tried either lived in someone
        else's data center or couldn't actually <em>do</em> anything. I wanted
        Siri's reach with a local model's privacy and a real agent's hands.
        Nobody was making it, so I did.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you try it and the third turn feels worse than I promised, email
        me directly. I want to know where it failed and make the purchase
        terms clear before you pay. That's the whole quality bar.
      </p>
      <p class="pace-display text-2xl text-white mt-8 not-italic">
        — <em>Sarthak</em>
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mt-1">
        <a href="mailto:hi@sarthakagrawal.dev" class="underline hover:text-white">hi@sarthakagrawal.dev</a>
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom-of-page chrome — keep it minimal, no four-column
         link grid. -->
    <div
      class="border-t border-[var(--color-border-subtle)] pt-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]"
    >
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-white">
        <span class="inline-flex items-end gap-[3px] h-5 w-6 text-[var(--color-accent)]" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="pace-bar h-3"></span>
          <span class="pace-bar h-5"></span>
          <span class="pace-bar h-4"></span>
          <span class="pace-bar h-3"></span>
        </span>
        <span class="font-semibold">Pace</span>
        <span class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)] ml-2 hidden md:inline">·</span>
        <span class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)] text-xs hidden md:inline">made for macOS in California</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-xs">
        <a href="/download" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Download</a>
        <a href="/pricing" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Pricing</a>
        <a href="/compared" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Compared</a>
        <a href="/faq" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">FAQ</a>
        <a href="/docs/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Docs</a>
        <a href="/changelog" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Changelog</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/HeyPace/pace/issues" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Roadmap</a>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/HeyPace/pace"
          aria-label="GitHub repository"
          title="GitHub repository"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="hover:text-white transition-colors inline-flex items-center"
        >
          <svg
            viewBox="0 0 16 16"
            width="20"
            height="20"
            fill="currentColor"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path
              d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27.68 0 1.36.09 2 .27 1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.013 8.013 0 0016 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8z"
            ></path>
          </svg>
          <span class="sr-only">GitHub repository</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Privacy</a>
        <a href="/terms" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Terms</a>
        <a href="mailto:hi@sarthakagrawal.dev" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Email</a>
        <span>© 2026</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
